{"summary":"灵床下鞋是放置在去世者床下的旧鞋，古医籍记载其有治疗脚气的功效，属于民间偏方，性味未明确，主治脚气（《本草拾遗》）。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"灵床下鞋，出自《本草拾遗》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"脚气（藏器）。","translation":"主治脚气，陈藏器说。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#靈床下鞋","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}